y but it's it's  it's amazing i love it during the  interview ed also revealed how  fatherhood has  changed the way he writes his music i'm  very structured with my day now so like  usually if i was in studio i would just  kind of work until it was done  i feel like with a kid you need a  structured  work day you can't be working until like  two o'clock in the morning you know she  has a nap structured she has a sleep  time structure in the bath time it's  just  i think that's the way the process has  changed while ed  isn't busy changing diapers next week he  will be appearing on the late late show  with james corden for a  week-long residency starting monday the  singer will be performing some of his  biggest hits each night kicking off with  a television debut of bad habits  but will also sit down with corden and  be featured in comedy segments  throughout the week  to you

